1. Install XAMPP

2. Open XAMPP Control Panel

3. Start:
   - Apache
   - MySQL

4. Open browser:
   http://localhost/phpmyadmin

5. Create Database:
   studentdb

6. Create Table:
   student

7. Add Columns:

   id      INT      PRIMARY KEY   AUTO_INCREMENT
   name    VARCHAR(50)
   marks   INT

8. Go to:
   C:\xampp\htdocs

9. Create Folder:
   student

10. Open folder in VS Code

11. Create file:
    insert.php

12. Paste this code:

<?php

$conn = mysqli_connect(
"localhost",
"root",
"",
"studentdb"
);

if(!$conn)
{
    die("Connection Failed");
}

$sql =
"INSERT INTO student(name,marks)
VALUES('Sahil',89)";

if(mysqli_query($conn,$sql))
{
    echo "Data Inserted Successfully";
}
else
{
    echo "Error";
}

mysqli_close($conn);

?>

13. Save file

14. Open browser and run:

http://localhost/student/insert.php

15. Output:

Data Inserted Successfully

16. Check inserted data:

Open:
http://localhost/phpmyadmin

Go to:
studentdb → student

You will see:

id   name    marks
1    Sahil   89
